{title: Koi Humdum Na Raha}
{artist: Kishore Kumar}
{key: D#}

{c: Verse 1}
[D#] [G#] [D#],        Koi humdum na raha koi
[C#] [D#],        sahara na raha
[D#] [G#] [C#],        Hum kisi ke na rahey
[G#] [D#],        koi hamara na raha
[D#],        Shaam tanhai ki hey aayegi
[C#] [D#],        manzil kaise
[D#] [G#],        Jo mujhe raah dikhaye wo hi
[C#] [D#],        taara na raha
[D#],        Kya bataaoon mey kahan yoon hi
[C#] [D#],        chala aata hoon
[D#] [G#],        Jo mujhe phir se bulaaye
[C#] [D#],        wo ishaara na raha
